title: AfterDemo_Initial
tags: #hub #reach
---
<<set $LineCount = 0>>
<<set $Minor_Token = true>>
<<set $InitialExecutedDay = $Today>>
<<RemoveAllNPC>>
<<ClearOptions>>
<<ChangeController WorkSpace IsClockOut no>>
<<ChangeController Window_LiveStream CanEndLive no>>
<<ChangeController Window_LiveStream CanLive no>>
<<ChangeController Window_LiveStream CanChangePerson yes>>
<<ChangeController Window_LiveStream Tutorial None>>
<<AllowDanmakuType default>>
<<LoadDanmaku>>
<<ChangeController WorkSpace Overlay DayStart>>
===

title: AfterDemo_Welcome
tags: #hub #reach
---
<<ChangeController WorkSpace Overlay Blank>>
<<Solo Aistalt>>
<<AfterDemoRefresh>>
<<if $AfterDemo_ErrorCount > 0>>
    <<jump AfterDemo_Error>>
<<elseif $AfterDemo_ReadyCount > 0>>
    Aistalt: 监督，今天继续匹配还没有聊过的直播事件。 #line:ad100001
    Aistalt: 当前可以开始的事件有 {$AfterDemo_ReadyCount} 个。开始菜单里的“续玩进度”可以查看详情。 #line:ad100002
    <<ChangeController Window_LiveStream CanLive yes>>
<<else>>
    <<jump AfterDemo_Finished>>
<<endif>>
===

title: AfterDemo_Live
tags: #hub #reach
---
<<StartDanmaku>>
<<StartLiveStatus>>
<<jump AfterDemo_Hub>>
===

title: AfterDemo_Hub
tags: #hub #reach #checkpoint #resume
---
<<Solo Aistalt>>
<<AfterDemoRefresh>>
<<if $AfterDemo_ErrorCount > 0>>
    <<jump AfterDemo_Error>>
<<elseif $AfterDemo_ReadyCount == 0>>
    <<jump AfterDemo_Finished>>
<<elseif $CurrentHour >= 18>>
    <<EndLiveStatus>>
    Aistalt: 今天先到这里。剩下的未见事件，明天继续。 #line:ad100003
    -> 进入下一天
        <<EndDay>>
    -> 留在桌面，稍后继续
        <<ChangeController Window_LiveStream CanEndLive yes>>
<<else>>
    <<set $LineCount += 1>>
    <<GenerateNPCOption Live_Entry 3>>
<<endif>>
===

title: AfterDemo_Resume
tags: #checkpoint #resume
---
<<OpenWindow Window_LiveStream>>
<<ChangeController WorkSpace Overlay Blank>>
<<ChangeController Window_LiveStream Status Live>>
<<ChangeController Window_LiveStream CanEndLive no>>
<<ClearOptions>>
<<ClearDanmaku>>
<<StartDanmaku>>
<<StartLiveStatus>>
<<jump AfterDemo_Hub>>
===

title: AfterDemo_DayEnd
tags: #hub #reach
---
<<EndLiveStatus>>
<<StopDanmaku>>
<<AfterDemoRefresh>>
<<if $AfterDemo_ErrorCount > 0>>
    <<jump AfterDemo_Error>>
<<elseif $AfterDemo_ReadyCount > 0>>
    <<EndDay>>
<<else>>
    <<jump AfterDemo_Finished>>
<<endif>>
===

title: AfterDemo_Finished
tags: #hub #reach
---
<<EndLiveStatus>>
<<StopDanmaku>>
<<ClearOptions>>
<<ChangeController Window_LiveStream CanLive no>>
<<ChangeController Window_LiveStream CanEndLive no>>
<<AfterDemoRefresh>>
<<if $AfterDemo_ErrorCount > 0>>
    <<jump AfterDemo_Error>>
<<endif>>
<<if $AfterDemo_UnseenCount == 0>>
    Aistalt: 当前续玩目录中的随机直播事件已经全部触发过了。感谢陪我聊到这里，监督。 #line:ad100004
<<else>>
    Aistalt: 当前剧情分支中，可以继续触发的随机直播事件已经完成。 #line:ad100005
    Aistalt: 还有 {$AfterDemo_UnseenCount} 个未见事件受到剧情前置或互斥选择限制。“续玩进度”里可以查看具体条件。 #line:ad100006
<<endif>>
<<AfterDemoFinished>>
-> 结束补充直播，查看新的简报
    <<AddNews News_Day8_Main_1>>
    <<AddPlayerInfo Info_Day8>>
    Aistalt: 等一下，监督。新的简报刚刚送到了。 #line:ad100007
    Aistalt: 洪水行动……看起来，我们的日常直播就先到这里了。 #line:ad100008
    Aistalt: 感谢您陪我完成这些连线。Demo 的故事在这里告一段落。 #line:ad100009
    <<set $AfterDemo_Closed = true>>
    <<EndGame NormalEnd>>
-> 留在桌面查看进度
    <<ChangeController Window_LiveStream CanEndLive yes>>
===

title: AfterDemo_Error
tags: #hub #reach
---
<<EndLiveStatus>>
<<ChangeController Window_LiveStream CanLive no>>
<<ChangeController Window_LiveStream CanEndLive no>>
Aistalt: 续玩目录暂时没有准备好。请在开始菜单的“续玩进度”中查看具体原因，再重新载入存档。 #line:ad100010
<<AfterDemoFinished>>
===

title: AfterDemo_Closed
tags: #hub #reach
---
<<ChangeController WorkSpace Overlay Blank>>
<<ChangeController Window_LiveStream CanLive no>>
<<ChangeController Window_LiveStream CanEndLive no>>
===

title: AfterDemo_Variables
---
<<declare $AfterDemo_ReadyCount = 0>>
<<declare $AfterDemo_UnseenCount = 0>>
<<declare $AfterDemo_ErrorCount = 0>>
<<declare $AfterDemo_Closed = false>>
===
